Mods derived from the Herdr app
-------------------------------

These mods are derived from mods of the Herdr app
(https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr-app), which are licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0. The license text is in LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt.
Koja changed each of them: they are ported to TypeScript, restyled, and draw
through Koja's UI kit. herdr/upstream.json records the Herdr release of each.

- src/mods/koja-changes, from defaults/mods/changes in Herdr 0.1.12
- src/mods/koja-menu, from defaults/mods/menu in Herdr 0.1.11
- src/mods/koja-new-menu, from defaults/mods/new-menu in Herdr 0.1.11
- src/mods/koja-palette, from defaults/frame/palette in Herdr 0.1.11
- src/mods/koja-pane, from defaults/mods/pane in Herdr 0.1.12
- src/mods/koja-spaces, from defaults/mods/spaces in Herdr 0.1.11
- src/mods/koja-tabs, from defaults/mods/tabs in Herdr 0.1.11

Scripts derived from the Herdr app
----------------------------------

These scripts are derived from scripts of the Herdr app
(https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr-app), which are licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0. The license text is in LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt.
Koja changed each of them: they run the installed herdr-app, install Koja's
mods and config into a private sandbox home, and stop only the processes the
sandbox started. herdr/upstream.json records the Herdr commit of each.

- scripts/sandbox, from scripts/sandbox at Herdr commit 65cd40a19d85f7c0044f89432285755ee0753a4e
- scripts/sandbox-input.py, from scripts/sandbox-input.py at Herdr commit 65cd40a19d85f7c0044f89432285755ee0753a4e

herdr/herdr.d.ts and herdr/gpui-kit.d.ts are copies of the type declarations
that Herdr 0.1.11 writes into its home folder.

