Fonts
-----

The fonts in config/fonts are Geist SemiBold and Geist Bold, and
eval/fonts/Geist-Regular.ttf is Geist Regular, all from Geist 1.8.0
(https://github.com/vercel/geist-font), licensed under the SIL Open Font
License, Version 1.1. The license text is in LICENSES/Geist-OFL.txt.
